5          /*
6          Program name: /udd/nhywa/GUTSOB/secondary_stratified/mom
7          Pogrammer: Bethsaida Cardona (n2bca)
8          Date started: 07/2025
9          Program Purpose: Calculate RRs and PARs for the association between maternal factors and obesity
10         stratified by age
11         Exposures: &mowestq_ [quantiles]; &mopaq_ [quantiles]; &mosmk_ [categorical]; &moshift_ [categorical];
12         	moob [binary]
13         Stratifiers: age (child <13 or child >=13)
14         Statistical Analyses:
15         	1) proc genmod to calculate multivariable log-binomial model with generalized estimating equations (GEE),
16         	a Poisson distribution, and an unstructured correlation structure, accounting for correlations across
17         	time for the same child and between siblings born to the same mother
18         	2) population attributable fraction with %par macro
19         
20         */
